      "supporting_url": "https://www.netlib.org/lapack/lug/node93.html",
      "review_level": "official implementation documentation, error-bound overview and cluster/invariant-subspace distinction",
      "review": {
        "ja": "非正規行列では小さな固有対残差と前進固有値誤差を同一視しません。固有値感度、個別固有ベクトル、固有値クラスターの不変部分空間を区別します。",
        "en": "Do not equate a small eigenpair residual with small forward eigenvalue error for nonnormal matrices; distinguish eigenvalue sensitivity, individual vectors, and clustered invariant subspaces."
      }
    }
